Package: bitUtils
Type: Package
Title: Utility Functions for Data Loading
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Jong-Hwa",
           family = "Shin",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "shin.jonghwa@modernity.or.kr")
Author: Jong-Hwa Shin [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jong-Hwa Shin <shin.jonghwa@modernity.or.kr>
Description: Interactive and scriptable helpers for loading CSV and
    tab-delimited files with 'data.table', converting Korean Windows
    encodings, and choosing a working directory. File dialogs remain the
    default; paths can also be supplied directly so the same functions work
    in scripts and tests.
License: GPL-3 + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/sens5900r/bitUtils
BugReports: https://github.com/sens5900r/bitUtils/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    tcltk,
    data.table
Suggests:
    gWidgets2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
